   "v": 3,
   "name": "p5",
   "intro": "Sometimes to get things done I have to train robots to do work for me. See if you can train a robot to make a box with two zeros in it. Mimi the copier is here to help. Give the box to the bird when you have it.",
   "goal": "a box with two zeros in it",
   "hints": [
    "You can train the robot if you give it the box with the zero in it. You\u2019ll end up in its imagination, and it remembers whatever you do.",
    "Set the box on Mimi\u2019s platform: a copy drops into the tray.",
    "Drop the copy on the side of the box and they join into one box.",
    "Here\u2019s what I\u2019d do. I\u2019d drop the box on the robot. Then I\u2019d have it set the box on Mimi, take the copy, and drop the copy on the side of the box. When I leave its thought bubble, I\u2019d give it the box and let it work \u2014 then give the bird the box it made."
